@@ -0,0 +1,258 @@
+/******************************************************************************
+ *
+ *  $Id$
+ *
+ *  Copyright (C) 2006-2008  Florian Pose, Ingenieurgemeinschaft IgH
+ *
+ *  This file is part of the IgH EtherCAT Master.
